# Upload list for `gcloud builds submit` (cloudbuild.yaml).
#
# CRITICAL: without this file, gcloud derives its ignore list from .gitignore, which
# excludes the model weights (engine/data/*.pt, *.npz, qwen_lora/) — the built image
# would then fail at container start. This file keeps engine/ (weights included) in the
# upload and trims everything the Docker build doesn't need, mirroring .dockerignore.
.git
.github
.env
docs/
infra/
tests/
training/
web/
db/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
